{{also|ramadan|ramadán}}
==English==
{{wikipedia|mul=Ramadan (calendar month)}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|Ramadhan|Ramadzan|Rhamadan}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|رَمَضَان}}, from {{m|ar|اِرْتَمَضَ||to be consumed by grief and sorrow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɹæməˈdɑːn/|/ˈɹæmədæn/}}
{{rfap|en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|Ramadans}}

# {{lb|en|Islam}} The [[holy]] ninth [[month]] of the [[Islamic]] [[lunar]] [[calendar]], during which [[Muslim]]s [[fast]] between the break of [[dawn]] until [[sunset]]; they also refrain from drinking liquids, [[smoking]] and having [[sexual]] [[relation]]s.
# {{given name|en|male}}

